    centring the grid -- correct only up to exactly 1440px wide, and on anything wider it
    left whitespace down both sides instead of letting the grid run edge-to-edge, which is
    the actual mismatch. No wrapper at all is what the reference does: `Section` no longer
    applies horizontal padding (`paddingY` above, not `padding`), and nothing further up the
    tree constrains width (checked `_app`/`_app-config`, including the base
    `retail-react-app` `_app` -- neither wraps page content in a `Container`), so the grid
    already spans the true viewport edge to edge on its own. */}
